-- תקנון שירות עובדי הוראה, פרק 3, §3.13 מורה מאמן
-- The training teacher's entitlement to the training allowance; its terms are §1.12's.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `3.13 מורה מאמן`

§§ `3.13.6 גמול אימון`

@desc A teaching employee as far as section 3.13.6 asks about them.
DECLARE `training-teacher post` HAS
    `serves as a training teacher` IS A BOOLEAN @desc the employee holds the post of training teacher (מורה מאמן)

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_13__ssec_3_13_6/p1
GIVEN t IS A `training-teacher post`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to the training allowance` t IF
    t's `serves as a training teacher`

-- akn:chp_3__sec_3_13__ssec_3_13_6/p2 A pointer: the allowance's amount and conditions are section 1.12's (appointments and allowances of role-holders), encoded there.

#ASSERT `entitled to the training allowance` (`training-teacher post` WITH `serves as a training teacher` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `entitled to the training allowance` (`training-teacher post` WITH `serves as a training teacher` IS FALSE)
